, one long curled tail, a teal vest and brown leather sandals. This one monkey bends forward, tilting a clear cylindrical glass honey jar so a thick golden stream lands on the scarf Pip is holding. His bent pouring pose replaces his standing reference pose.\nSuki, the right reference character, is the greyish-brown shaggy sloth with dark almond eyes, a gentle smile, a pale pink apron with a front pocket and purple slippers. This one sloth stands nearby watching the honey land on the scarf.\n\nThe single scarf is long golden-yellow wool with chunky cable knitting and short matching fringe tassels at both ends. It lies naturally on the grass and is soaked in golden honey. The jar contains viscous golden honey. Show the shared action clearly, with the stream connecting the tilted jar to the scarf.\n\nKeep their canonical body sizes through their new poses: Pip is 60 cm tall, Momo 50 cm, Suki 45 cm. Pip is about 1.2 times Momo's standing height and 1.3 times Suki's. Three characters total: one penguin, one monkey, one sloth, each with its own separate natural anatomy. The same three friends perform all the actions in this single moment.\n\nWarm hand-painted children's book illustration, soft gouache and coloured-pencil texture, clear shapes, expressive natural poses, gentle lighting. Warm pastel palette: butter-yellow, mint-green, soft coral and shimmering iridescent tones. Full-bleed garden artwork without lettering or portrait panels."]},{"id":121,"type":"FluxGuidance","pos":[800,200],"size":[280,84],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"conditioning","type":"CONDITIONING","link":6}],"outputs":[{"name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[7]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FluxGuidance"},"widgets_values":[2.5]},{"id":122,"type":"ReferenceLatent","pos":[1180,60],"size":[280,80],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"conditioning","type":"CONDITIONING","link":7},{"name":"latent","type":"LATENT","link":8}],"outputs":[{"name":"CONDITIO